{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/199e1cbeb77af5b7a11ac568cbbaafa0.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scuff Slayer is a lore-driven bullet hell where you step into the boots of a soldier trapped in an endless war</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Simplification of Humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2022. Five years ago, a demonic entity descended upon the Earth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the False God.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/90523807ef7caf7831dc1a827106b17c.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/fbd1854b23e9ee9cbe52b152a009c4dc.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=779 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The False God, also known as The Simplifier, reduced humanity to its most fragile form in an event now remembered as The Scuff Invasion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People said humanity was doomed\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world swallowed by chaos, where hope had crumbled and even God seemed silent\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a man appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting through the disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoring faith.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scuff Slayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/0c0dbf40a52427eb530f25b2899b026e.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/da87eb3e34aadfca9ab3085487b5b679.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=779 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scuff Slayer features <strong>over 400 unique abilities</strong> you can unleash in this bullet hell where<br><strong>YOU ARE THE SWARM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chaotic idea from Slayer\u2019s twisted mind becomes a weapon:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars.<br>Flip-flops.<br>Nature itself.<br>Even the <i>root</i> of your own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it exists, you can turn it into destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/e6dd47eddfdaaca3ff2ccebd861a5cdf.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/5b731c0e8bb4d05683b19a29e52fb235.avif?t=1770655382\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras_big/5b731c0e8bb4d05683b19a29e52fb235.webp?t=1770655382 width=1560 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this apocalypse, there is only one true source of power:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the link between a being and the core of reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True and False.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One and Zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boolean soul behind existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn it. Bend it. Break the world with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/776297c693066a808a274a1f13c849ea.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/8d8844064b1662048608173f59c396e0.avif?t=1770655382\" width=1200 height=779 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">ALL THINGS MUST COME TO AN END.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Binary Respiration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"The Young Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"First Mission... When's Vacation?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"God?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Christmas Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":" The Alpha...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Scuff Riddle... Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Captain? What Are You Doing Here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco